  "Sell any token for USDC at a fixed price or at the live market price with a discount or premium. Buyers take all or part of a listing and pay native USDC in one transaction. Tokens stay in escrow until sold or withdrawn.": "以固定价格或跟随实时市场价加减折扣，把任意代币卖成 USDC。买家可整笔或部分买入挂单，一笔交易内用原生 USDC 付款。代币在售出或取回前一直留在托管中。",
  "Sell any token for USDC. Buy any listing, whole or in part.": "把任意代币卖成 USDC。整笔或部分买入任意挂单。",
  "A permissionless order book on Arc. Sellers escrow tokens and name a price: a fixed USDC amount, or the live Uniswap price with a discount or premium. Buyers pay native USDC and receive tokens in the same transaction, no account and no approval.": "Arc 上无需许可的订单簿。卖家托管代币并定价：固定的 USDC 金额，或实时 Uniswap 价格加减折扣。买家支付原生 USDC，并在同一笔交易中收到代币，无需账户，无需授权。",
  "The ArcP2P contract is deployed and verified on Arc. The order book opens to everyone shortly. Here is exactly how it works.": "ArcP2P 合约已在 Arc 上部署并验证。订单簿很快向所有人开放。以下是它的具体运作方式。",
  "For sellers": "面向卖家",
  "List any token, name your price": "挂出任意代币，自己定价",
  "Escrow any ERC-20 on Arc and set a price in USDC. No listing approval, no minimum size. Cancel any time and the unsold tokens come straight back.": "托管 Arc 上任意 ERC-20 并以 USDC 定价。无需上架审核，没有最低数量。随时取消，未售出的代币立即返还。",
  "Dynamic pricing": "动态定价",
  "Market price, plus or minus a spread": "市场价，加减一个价差",
  "Peg a listing to the token's Uniswap v4 USDC pool and sell at market, 5% below it, 10% above it, whatever you choose. The price re-reads the pool on every fill, with an optional floor you never sell under. Or set a fixed USDC price that never moves.": "把挂单锚定到代币的 Uniswap v4 USDC 池，按市场价、低 5%、高 10%，随你选择。每次成交都会重新读取池子价格，还可设置永不低于的底价。或者设定一个永不变动的固定 USDC 价格。",
  "For buyers": "面向买家",
  "Take all of it or just a slice": "全部买下，或只买一部分",
  "Pay native USDC and receive the tokens in the same transaction. Buy the whole listing or any part above the seller's minimum. Any USDC sent beyond the price is refunded in the same call.": "支付原生 USDC，并在同一笔交易中收到代币。可买下整个挂单，或任意高于卖家最小量的部分。多付的 USDC 在同一调用中退还。",
  "Manipulation resistant": "抗操纵",
  "Higher of 30-minute average and spot": "取 30 分钟均价与现价中的较高者",
  "Market-priced listings use the higher of the pool's 30-minute time-weighted average and its spot price, so a flash dump in the pool cannot drain a discounted listing.": "市场价挂单取池子 30 分钟时间加权均价与现价中的较高者，因此池内的瞬间砸盘无法掏空折扣挂单。",
